=====Usage notes=====
Usage with names of days like {{m|id|Jumat||Friday}}, {{m|id|Senin||Monday}}:
* When placed before the day name means "night before {{smallcaps|day}}": '''''malam''' Jumat'' "night before Friday"
* When placed after the day name means "night of {{smallcaps|day}}": ''Jumat '''malam''''' "night of Friday"

